  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building a cold store in the port of Tema, Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wegdam Food Link BV and its local partner in Ghana have jointly set up a successful meat trade in Ghana. With a loan and a guarantee of the DGGF and a loan from Rabobank, Wegdam Food Link BV shall be able to build a cold store in the port of Tema, Ghana. Through this additional cooling capacity, the trade capacity of the Dutch company and its local partner is significantly increased. 50 jobs will be created at the cold store. Furthermore, solar panels will be placed on the roof of the cold store. They will supply a large part of the required energy to the cold store.</narrative>
  </description>
